cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these datasets, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "World Money Roadmap market datasets"
abstract: >-
  CSV datasets from the World Money Roadmap market data site: U.S. Federal
  Reserve target rate changes, U.S. and Korean market dates, trading days per
  month, quarterly and annual U.S. company financials from SEC EDGAR XBRL, and
  the daily value and metrics of the site's AI paper-trading accounts.
authors:
  - name: "World Money Roadmap"
    website: "https://worldmoneyroadmap.com"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/worldmoneyroadmap/wmr-market-datasets"
repository: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/worldmoneyroadmap/wmr-market-datasets"
url: "https://worldmoneyroadmap.com/en/data/"
date-released: "2026-11-21"
keywords:
  - finance
  - economics
  - stock market
  - interest rates
  - SEC EDGAR
  - market calendar
